{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45425","headline":"驾幸圣容院应制 · 广宣","name":"驾幸圣容院应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大唐国里千年圣，王舍城中百亿身。\n却指容颜非我相，自言空色是吾真。\n深殿虔心随宝辇，广庭徐步引金轮。\n古来贵重缘亲近，狂客慙爲侍从臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}